        "line": 917,
        "volume": "1"
      },
      "text": "知道不同错误的成本后，我们可以从损失推导处置阈值。\\BookSectionRef{sec:decision-bayes-rules}{第一卷“策略、价值与优化”章的“Bayes决策”一节}已经建立条件风险与Bayes行动，这里只比较邮件隔离和放行。设$p$为给定输入下邮件属于垃圾邮件的真实概率，误拦成本为$c_{\\mathrm{fp}}>0$，漏放成本为$c_{\\mathrm{fn}}>0$，正确处理暂不计成本。隔离只有遇到正常邮件才产生损失，其条件期望为$(1-p)c_{\\mathrm{fp}}$；放行的条件期望为$pc_{\\mathrm{fn}}$。选择损失较小的行动，隔离条件便是"
    },
    {
      "source": "tex/02-foundations/03-trustworthiness/02-reliability.tex",
      "line": 148,
      "macro": "BookDefinitionRef",
      "label": "def:statistics-probability-calibration",
      "target": {
        "path": "tex/01-mathematical-preliminaries/04-random-variables-distributions-and-causality/01-random-variables.tex",
        "line": 4182,
        "volume": "1"
      },
      "text": "邮件的0.9需要对照哪些结果？依照\\BookDefinitionRef{def:statistics-probability-calibration}{第一卷“随机变量”章的“概率校准”定义}，二分类中记$y\\in\\{0,1\\}$，$p(\\bm{x})$报告$y=1$的概率，我们检查同一分数下的事件均值："
    },
    {
      "source": "tex/02-foundations/03-trustworthiness/02-reliability.tex",
      "line": 320,
      "macro": "BookTheoremRef",
      "label": "thm:probability-split-conformal-coverage",
      "target": {
        "path": "tex/01-mathematical-preliminaries/04-random-variables-distributions-and-causality/01-random-variables.tex",
        "line": 4318,
        "volume": "1"
      },
      "text": "\\BookTheoremRef{thm:probability-split-conformal-coverage}{第一卷“随机变量”章的拆分共形覆盖定理}已经证明，可交换秩使上述构造满足"
    },
    {
      "source": "tex/02-foundations/03-trustworthiness/03-robustness.tex",
      "line": 241,
      "macro": "BookSectionRef",
      "label": "sec:decision-risk-criteria-robustness",
      "target": {
        "path": "tex/01-mathematical-preliminaries/05-dynamical-systems-control-decision-and-games/03-policy-value-and-optimization.tex",
        "line": 185,
        "volume": "1"
      },
      "text": "允许分布族$\\mathfrak Q$需先按任务规定，例如容许已声明环境的比例改变，或容许参考分布附近预设距离内的变化。\\term{分布鲁棒优化}（distributionally robust optimization, DRO）比较族内最高风险，并从模型候选$\\mathcal F$中选择使这一风险最小的模型。\\BookSectionRef{sec:decision-risk-criteria-robustness}{第一卷“策略、价值与优化”章的“风险准则与鲁棒决策”一节}给出一般定义，此处监督学习形式是"
    },
    {
      "source": "tex/02-foundations/03-trustworthiness/04-fairness.tex",
      "line": 203,
      "macro": "BookSectionRef",
      "label": "sec:causal-counterfactual-recourse",
      "target": {
        "path": "tex/01-mathematical-preliminaries/04-random-variables-distributions-and-causality/03-causal-response-and-structure.tex",
        "line": 406,
        "volume": "1"
      },
      "text": "关注禁止因素怎样传递影响时，需要因果模型。\\BookSectionRef{sec:causal-counterfactual-recourse}{第一卷“因果响应”章的“反事实与补救”一节}已建立条件反事实。反事实公平（counterfactual fairness）固定同一个体的外生背景，再比较不同群体属性干预下的预测，而非直接配对现实中的两人；Kusner等据此给出定义\\scite{kusner2017counterfactual}。"
    },
    {
      "source": "tex/02-foundations/03-trustworthiness/05-alignment.tex",
      "line": 74,
      "macro": "BookSectionRef",
      "label": "sec:policy-trajectory-return",
      "target": {
        "path": "tex/01-mathematical-preliminaries/05-dynamical-systems-control-decision-and-games/03-policy-value-and-optimization.tex",
        "line": 125,
        "volume": "1"
      },
      "text": "邮件整理既希望提高效率，也需要限制误删等风险成本，因而只最大化效率奖励还不足以表达全部要求。\\BookSectionRef{sec:policy-trajectory-return}{第一卷“策略的价值与优化”章的“轨迹与回报”一节}和\\BookSectionRef{sec:decision-risk-criteria-robustness}{同章的“风险准则与鲁棒决策”一节}给出了策略、回报与风险约束的接口。这里考察这些数学对象能否表达授权后的任务要求。设策略$\\pi$按历史$h_t$选择动作$a_t$，$r_t$为奖励，$c_t\\geq0$为风险成本，$T$为时域，$b$为预算。一种常见表述为"
    },
    {
      "source": "tex/02-foundations/03-trustworthiness/05-alignment.tex",
